    {
     "kind": "note",
     "text": "The IDG disconnection is inhibited, when the engine is stopped or below idle. Press the IDG pb-sw until the GEN FAULT light comes on. However, do not press for more than 3 s, to avoid damage to the disconnect solenoid. The IDG FAULT light goes off, when the IDG is disconnected.",
